<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Registration Successful</title>

    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>

    <style>
        body{
            background-image:
            linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.65), rgba(0,0,0,.65)),
            url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503376780353-7e6692767b70?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80");

            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .glass{
            backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
        }

        @keyframes zoom {
            0%{transform:scale(.7);opacity:0;}
            100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:1;}
        }

        .card{
            animation: zoom .8s ease;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="flex justify-center items-center">

<div class="glass card w-[450px] p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl text-center">

    <div class="w-24 h-24 mx-auto rounded-full bg-green-500 flex items-center justify-center text-5xl mb-6 shadow-lg">
        ✅
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-4">
        Registration Successful!
    </h1>

    <p class="text-gray-200 text-lg leading-8">
        🎉 Congratulations!<br>
        Your account has been created successfully.<br>
        Welcome to our Premium Car Club.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex gap-4 justify-center">

        <a href="/login"
        class="bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl text-white font-bold transition">
            Login Now
        </a>

        <a href="/"
        class="bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-800 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl text-white font-bold transition">
            Home
        </a>

    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>